{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to our facility! Here, you\u2019ll experience the thrill of strategic duels \u2013 block attacks, acquire ammo, and shoot your opponent. We hope you enjoy your stay with us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo includes all the features of the main game except story progression.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rules</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The rules are similar to rock, paper, scissors: Both players make decisions at the same time. They have three options: block, get ammo, and shoot. In order to shoot, the player needs to get ammo first, but if the opponent shoots when the player gets ammo, they get shot. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Play with Friends or Strangers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917410/extras/7fa2e7367a234261222c8e84f5529921.poster.avif?t=1754581479\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917410/extras/7fa2e7367a234261222c8e84f5529921.webm?t=1754581479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917410/extras/7fa2e7367a234261222c8e84f5529921.mp4?t=1754581479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge your friends or use  matchmaking to connect with other  nasty friendly guests!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Ability Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917410/extras/6dd585ccfc4df48fd48e8db414657ba5.poster.avif?t=1754581479\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917410/extras/6dd585ccfc4df48fd48e8db414657ba5.webm?t=1754581479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917410/extras/6dd585ccfc4df48fd48e8db414657ba5.mp4?t=1754581479\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain the upper hand with powerful ability cards that can turn the tide of any duel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Edit Your Face</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917410/extras/cb49b026074180a41f82f05e3a9ee652.poster.avif?t=1754581479\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917410/extras/cb49b026074180a41f82f05e3a9ee652.webm?t=1754581479\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We understand the importance of self-expression. Customize your helmet and show the world your true face \u2013 or at least, the one you want to show.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3917410?t=1754581479","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917410/fdc7aab43f4c1e58cf842cd275bc0ac9b4c105c8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754581479","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917410/555668481805de0642aead8b3fe39b3a9d4cc41a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754581479","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917410/555668481805de0642aead8b3fe39b3a9d4cc41a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754581479","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The Panopticon depicts violence and blood."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to our facility! Here, you\u2019ll